# UI/UX modernization track (D-012)

## Always

- Read `docs/architecture/target-ux.md` when building any TARGET UI.
- UI/UX is a **first-class track** parallel to API/data strangler — not optional polish.
- Default UI: **Razor Pages** (.NET 10). **Blazor** only for dense interactive modules (D-005).

## Must

- Use TARGET layout/chrome and shared tokens/patterns.
- RTL/culture via layout + resources — no new `*_ar` page forks.
- No new iframes inside modern screens (legacy Agenda may host Mode A bridge).
- Do not port `App_Themes` / `.skin` as the design system.
- Do not introduce React/Vue/Next as default.

## Per slice DoD

Layout ✓ · tokens/components ✓ · LTR+RTL ✓ · list/detail pattern ✓ · a11y basics ✓
